Subject: [PATCH 04/10] harness: witness rule for measurement evidence and pcc
 claim types (I6b, I11)

check_evidence_witness: EV records from 2026-11-11 that cite runs must name
a witness (sampled_replay, independent_reexecution or certificate; advisory
until 2026-12-11, then error). pcc: claim_type data|literature|interpretive
required on new claims, sample-for-validation stratified at >= 3x for
interpretive claims, standing-by-type. pcc files are lab-shared; the lock
and mirrors update in the crypto PR.

